SUMMARY:Starry Night 4
DESCRIPTION:April 30\, 2026  // 7:30pm // $20\nall prices + fees\nBUY TICKETS \nIt’s back! Starry Night 4! Hosted by local musician and Bike Rally participant\, Andrew Starr\, this PWA fundraiser is always a good time! Get ready for an intimate acoustic set with ex Slave to the Squarewave members Colin Troy and Andrew Starr. They will be performing some 70’s and 80’s classics with an acoustic twist. To finish off the night\, newly formed super group the Guilty Pistols are going to turn up the volume and have you all dancing on the Buddies dance floor. There is also a silent auction happening with a some great swag from local merchants from around the Church Wellesley Village. Bring your big oversized purse and help raise funds for the PWA Bikerally! \nPERFORMERS:\n \nAndrew Starr\nColin Troy\nJarod Maclean\nStewart Borden\nLandon Clarkson\nMike Daniels\nDionisio Silva
URL:https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/starry-night-4/
LOCATION:Tallulahs
END:VEVENT
